OL,5,G2255 The Movies
OL,6,     FThe Eighties, Part 1: The journey
OL,7,     Fthrough American cinema continues
OL,8,     Finto the 1980s, with hits that
OL,9,     Fbecame cult classics from E.T. to
OL,10,     FThe Breakfast Club. (S1, ep 7)
OL,11,G2355 Alec Guinness: A Class Act
OL,12,     FRecounted through family, friends
OL,13,     Fand peers, explore the brilliant
OL,14,     Fcareer of late Oscar winner Alec
OL,15,     FGuinness - beginning with his 1934
OL,16,     Fdebut at the Playhouse Theatre.
OL,17,G0155 Blue Road: The Edna O'Brien Story
OL,18,     FEdna O'Brien, 93, reflects on her
OL,19,     Flife, novels and love through
OL,20,     Fjournals read by Jessie Buckley,
OL,21,     Fwith insight from writers like
OL,22,     FGabriel Byrne.
